      "writtenOn": "2022-07-22T15:17:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since you already know if the glyph is drawable backed and since you already have a drawable in hand, why not just return it? The complexity with the OpenType backed drawables was mostly that there is already a \"picture\" but in a different format and we wanted to avoid the time and space overhead of converting that into a picture if possible. But here you already have a drawable to return.\n\nNote that this code path currently gets used at large sizes. Could be tested by adding one larger size to the test affected or just look at it in viewer and size it up.",
      "revId": "1eb7c70443372cdaa39f3bac422c3d7c1a97e0c2",
